#: kcm/ui/main.qml:135
msgctxt "@info placeholder"
msgid "Nothing on this computer needs attention. When something fails, it is listed here until it is repaired, and what you dismiss stays listed here too, so you can bring it back."
msgstr "这台计算机上没有需要处理的事情。出现故障时，它会列在这里直到修复；你忽略的问题也会留在这里，方便你恢复。"

